WEBVTT

00:02.370 --> 00:07.990
You committed a grave crime 
by slaying a demon emissary

00:07.990 --> 00:11.320
who visited the academy the other day.

00:11.320 --> 00:13.740
You admit this, don't you?

00:14.540 --> 00:15.990
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:16.400 --> 00:18.410
So you refuse to admit it?

00:18.770 --> 00:20.490
Arrest her!

00:20.490 --> 00:23.210
We will take you to the capital.

00:21.950 --> 00:23.210
Don't touch me!

00:23.990 --> 00:25.120
Wait!

00:25.480 --> 00:27.290
Amyu wouldn't...

00:27.770 --> 00:30.760
Mabel, Yifa. Don't.

00:30.760 --> 00:32.820
Amyu, don't worry about a thing.

00:32.820 --> 00:36.840
You're innocent. I'm sure 
they'll let you go soon.

00:37.760 --> 00:39.140
What did you say, kid?

00:39.140 --> 00:41.020
Are you mocking us?

00:41.020 --> 00:42.630
You're just a mere student...

00:42.630 --> 00:43.680
Stop!

00:43.920 --> 00:47.020
The sons and daughters of 
nobles attend this academy.

00:47.260 --> 00:49.280
Don't cause any problems.

00:49.280 --> 00:50.150
Let's go.

01:16.300 --> 01:27.390
<b>The Reincarnation of
the Strongest Exorcist in Another World</b>

02:30.470 --> 02:34.710
So they're saying Amyu killed 
an emissary from the demons?

02:35.150 --> 02:38.680
It's true that the demons were here.

02:38.680 --> 02:41.390
I wonder who it was who dealt with them.

02:43.050 --> 02:48.730
So, did you come to blame me for allowing 
them to arrest one of my students?

02:48.730 --> 02:54.650
No. It seems to me that the empire is trying 
to come up with a reason to kill the hero.

02:54.650 --> 02:56.320
And I want to know why.

02:56.320 --> 02:59.950
Not everyone in the empire 
agrees about everything.

03:00.620 --> 03:04.740
They're not being driven by pure greed.

03:04.740 --> 03:07.660
Politics is complicated, however.

03:07.660 --> 03:10.040
Yes, I'm aware.

03:10.470 --> 03:14.580
I'm applying pressure on the Imperial 
court from a variety of angles.

03:14.580 --> 03:16.840
Just sit and wait for good news.

03:17.680 --> 03:20.510
And don't get any ideas.

03:21.170 --> 03:24.680
What do you mean by "ideas," ma'am?

03:26.060 --> 03:30.620
I'm curious, though. How long will it be
before this "pressure" bears fruit?

03:30.620 --> 03:33.070
Are you sure it will be able to save her

03:33.070 --> 03:35.770
before she dies under 
suspicious circumstances?

03:37.550 --> 03:40.360
I'm sorry. That was a cruel thing to ask.

03:40.660 --> 03:44.440
I understand that you're doing 
everything you can for Amyu.

03:44.440 --> 03:46.440
And I'm grateful to you for it.

03:47.120 --> 03:47.860
Farewell.

03:52.330 --> 03:54.740
Will Seika be okay?

03:54.740 --> 04:00.080
If Seika decides to bring 
Amyu back, I'll go with him.

04:00.080 --> 04:01.810
Yeah, me, too.

04:02.470 --> 04:03.720
Seika!

04:03.720 --> 04:05.510
What will you do now?

04:05.780 --> 04:09.180
Don't worry. The principal 
says she'd handle it.

04:09.180 --> 04:12.200
So you're going to wait here?

04:12.200 --> 04:13.740
I feel bad for Amyu.

04:13.740 --> 04:15.070
Calm down.

04:15.070 --> 04:17.670
You know there's nothing the 
three of us can do about this.

04:18.420 --> 04:20.280
You're really going to wait?

04:20.280 --> 04:21.340
Yup.

04:26.720 --> 04:27.570
Summoning.

04:28.960 --> 04:29.940
Mizuchi.

04:37.540 --> 04:40.520
Look, ryuu. Look at me.

04:40.520 --> 04:42.880
Am I unworthy to be your master?

04:43.450 --> 04:44.400
Ryuu!

04:53.930 --> 04:56.810
What an irritating ayakashi.

04:56.810 --> 04:59.820
I know I'm overstepping, Seika,

05:00.200 --> 05:04.470
but I think that if you really want 
to be smart in this new world,

05:04.470 --> 05:08.950
you should give up on saving that girl.

05:08.950 --> 05:11.990
I suppose I should listen to your reason. So why?

05:12.480 --> 05:19.620
You're about to unleash your power on 
this nation's most important people.

05:20.280 --> 05:22.400
If you attract their attention,

05:22.400 --> 05:24.770
it might end up the same as your last life.

05:24.770 --> 05:27.300
Isn't that what you said?

05:27.300 --> 05:29.040
What of it?

05:29.040 --> 05:30.890
There's only one hero.

05:30.890 --> 05:35.230
If anybody sees my power, I'll just make 
sure they don't live to tell about it.

05:35.230 --> 05:40.380
Seika, why are you so angry?

05:43.570 --> 05:47.470
Shouldn't you think this through?

05:47.470 --> 05:52.870
Enough. You're just an ayakashi. Are you 
still trying to tell me what to do, Yuki?

05:53.340 --> 06:00.010
No, if this is what you've decided, 
then I have nothing left to say to you.

06:04.030 --> 06:06.970
Head west, ryuu.

06:22.980 --> 06:25.360
What will happen to me now?

06:25.920 --> 06:28.740
<i>I wonder if Yifa and Mabel 
are worried about me.</i>

06:29.950 --> 06:33.320
<i>Maybe I'll never be able to 
adventure with you again,</i>

06:34.880 --> 06:36.040
<i>Seika...</i>

06:41.030 --> 06:42.080
Who's there?

06:43.570 --> 06:45.270
Y-You're...

06:54.880 --> 06:56.910
It's a long way by carriage,

06:56.910 --> 06:58.730
but it only takes a moment on his back.

07:04.770 --> 07:07.190
On pancharika vidi sowaka.

07:24.450 --> 07:28.150
Oh, there you are, Amyu.

07:38.230 --> 07:40.000
This castle is worthless.

07:40.000 --> 07:43.860
You can just walk right in from the air.

07:44.960 --> 07:46.650
A-An intruder?

07:47.170 --> 07:48.980
Halt! Who are you?

07:49.220 --> 07:50.320
Halt!

08:02.710 --> 08:04.420
Archers! Fire!

08:06.420 --> 08:07.540
Phase of sunlight.

08:07.970 --> 08:09.460
Spell of Magnetic Storm.

08:12.300 --> 08:13.470
Our arrows!

08:13.470 --> 08:14.800
Just keep firing!

08:14.800 --> 08:16.470
Don't let him make a mess of the castle!

08:18.390 --> 08:20.300
Irritating.

08:21.470 --> 08:22.390
Phase of earth.

08:24.170 --> 08:25.790
Spell of Keystone.

08:30.970 --> 08:33.160
The cells were this way.

08:33.160 --> 08:34.060
Halt!

08:35.550 --> 08:37.410
Who are you?

08:37.680 --> 08:39.910
What are you doing in the castle?!

08:40.670 --> 08:41.580
You're in the way.

08:42.850 --> 08:44.300
Make way.

08:45.210 --> 08:49.420
Do as I say, and I'll let you live.

08:50.200 --> 08:51.260
Fire!

08:56.470 --> 08:59.260
<i>How annoying.</i>

08:59.260 --> 09:02.600
<i>Phase of sun and fire. 
Spell of White Flames.</i>

09:09.110 --> 09:11.820
Stand fast! Fire!

09:11.820 --> 09:12.950
Summoning.

09:14.070 --> 09:15.430
Sickle weasel.

09:58.800 --> 09:59.580
Amyu.

10:02.240 --> 10:03.650
Seika?

10:03.650 --> 10:04.560
You okay in there?

10:07.010 --> 10:08.740
How'd you get here?

10:08.740 --> 10:10.650
It was a bit of a trip, I'll tell you that.

10:10.650 --> 10:11.960
Now, let's go.

10:11.960 --> 10:15.460
Do you know what'll happen if you do this?

10:15.460 --> 10:18.810
It might cause problems for your family, too!

10:20.870 --> 10:23.760
Your life's in danger.

10:23.760 --> 10:27.850
I know that. I am fine, though.

10:28.500 --> 10:30.400
They'll understand.

10:30.900 --> 10:32.980
I'll be out of here in no time.

10:33.430 --> 10:36.360
So leave!

10:36.800 --> 10:38.450
Go wait for me at school.

10:38.450 --> 10:40.240
I'll be back soon.

10:42.330 --> 10:44.910
That won't happen, Amyu...

10:46.800 --> 10:50.030
because you're the hero.

10:51.380 --> 10:55.070
Th-The hero?

10:56.090 --> 10:57.070
Correct.

10:57.730 --> 10:59.430
The hero in the fairy tales.

10:59.950 --> 11:01.710
The human hero who reincarnates

11:01.710 --> 11:04.800
once every few centuries,
at the same time as the demon king.

11:04.800 --> 11:07.550
You're the hero this time, Amyu.

11:08.260 --> 11:10.230
Th-That doesn't mean...

11:10.850 --> 11:13.680
There's a reason you're going to be killed.

11:13.680 --> 11:17.700
Those without power fear those who have it.

11:17.700 --> 11:20.240
They shun them. They eliminate them.

11:20.700 --> 11:22.000
In every era...

11:22.840 --> 11:24.600
In every world.

11:28.440 --> 11:29.830
Let's go, Amyu.

11:30.300 --> 11:32.580
They'll kill you if you stay.

11:32.580 --> 11:35.100
Quickly, before dawn.

11:35.710 --> 11:36.660
Phase of fire and earth.

11:36.660 --> 11:37.990
Spell of Ghostlight!

11:41.770 --> 11:42.540
Hello there.

11:45.700 --> 11:46.720
Brother Gly.

11:49.740 --> 11:52.310
We meet again. Sooner than I thought.

11:52.700 --> 11:54.480
Want to have that duel?

11:54.770 --> 11:57.100
We never did get the chance.

11:57.910 --> 12:00.820
Seika, what are you...

12:00.820 --> 12:03.700
There's no need for that.

12:06.380 --> 12:07.280
Fiona?

12:07.520 --> 12:12.480
I see. So you saw this moment ahead of time.

12:13.360 --> 12:15.710
So are you going to explain 
what's going on here?

12:16.150 --> 12:22.010
Or are you going to send that group of 
weaklings you have waiting outside after me?

12:22.010 --> 12:26.720
They're simply watching to 
make sure no one interrupts.

12:27.200 --> 12:31.930
I'd like to think I know how 
dangerous it is to fight you.

12:32.430 --> 12:34.600
Then what are you doing here?

12:34.850 --> 12:37.280
I've come to answer your questions.

12:37.280 --> 12:39.820
As a show of good faith.

12:40.290 --> 12:45.280
It'll make it easier for you 
to accept my offer, as well.

12:45.580 --> 12:48.450
Your "offer"? That's one way to put it.

12:49.220 --> 12:53.120
Tell me, then. 
Why is Amyu about to be killed?

12:53.680 --> 12:56.110
It makes no sense why you'd 
throw away your advantage

12:56.580 --> 12:59.840
when you have a clear enemy in the demons.

13:00.730 --> 13:04.010
This was once a small nation.

13:04.010 --> 13:07.600
We conscripted the people to fight 
our battles against the demons.

13:07.600 --> 13:10.260
We didn't have the slightest 
idea what tactics even were.

13:10.510 --> 13:15.660
And then, the hero came,
and what a relief that must have been...

13:15.660 --> 13:19.850
A hero who fought terrible demons 
for us, with holy sword in hand...

13:19.850 --> 13:22.440
They must have seemed like a symbol of hope.

13:23.520 --> 13:27.720
But now, the demons and the 
empire both have armies.

13:28.320 --> 13:30.740
Do you know what means, Seika?

13:31.030 --> 13:35.910
The demon king and the hero 
are both relics of the past.

13:35.910 --> 13:40.840
A single hero is no longer 
enough to conquer a city.

13:41.880 --> 13:43.760
And why does that matter?

13:43.760 --> 13:46.400
Why does that give you a reason to kill her?

13:46.400 --> 13:49.260
If she's of no use to you, 
then just ignore her.

13:49.730 --> 13:55.680
The hero carries the potential 
to start a war just by existing.

13:56.080 --> 14:00.560
But now, nobody wants a war.

14:01.080 --> 14:03.570
The demons probably feel the same way.

14:04.410 --> 14:07.620
That's why they're sending assassins.

14:08.170 --> 14:11.880
They don't want to win the war.

14:11.880 --> 14:15.200
They want to stop it from happening.

14:16.060 --> 14:22.750
And I'll also add that Amyu will never 
attain the power of the last hero.

14:24.170 --> 14:25.170
Why?

14:25.570 --> 14:29.590
Because you're here, Seika.

14:31.020 --> 14:35.340
The hero gains strength 
by overcoming hardship.

14:35.340 --> 14:40.230
It only comes to them after fighting 
powerful foes again and again.

14:40.630 --> 14:44.740
Would you let Amyu be in that kind of danger?

14:44.740 --> 14:48.940
Someone strong and kind enough to 
attack the Imperial castle itself?

14:50.690 --> 14:54.170
If her strength is the reason
you're so intent on helping the hero,

14:54.880 --> 14:58.080
things won't play out
the way you seem to expect.

14:58.320 --> 15:00.580
So what?

15:00.580 --> 15:04.000
If she's not going to be what I want 
her to be, I should just let her die?

15:04.000 --> 15:07.540
Let her die so everyone else can have peace?

15:08.010 --> 15:09.670
Is that what you're saying?

15:09.940 --> 15:13.350
That's not what I want.

15:13.930 --> 15:19.390
The academy and its allies are 
doing their best to protect her.

15:19.900 --> 15:21.530
So am I!

15:22.880 --> 15:26.490
Seika... I'm asking you for just one thing.

15:27.240 --> 15:28.870
Leave, for now.

15:29.740 --> 15:35.330
I'll use every bit of power I have 
to ensure she returns home safely.

15:35.860 --> 15:38.720
You'll never be arrested 
for what you did tonight.

15:39.370 --> 15:41.020
So, please...

15:41.020 --> 15:42.640
I see.

15:42.640 --> 15:46.160
The reason you wanted to see me and 
Amyu was so that in this moment,

15:46.160 --> 15:48.300
you could make that demand.

15:49.730 --> 15:51.830
Yes, that's right.

15:51.830 --> 15:55.470
I wanted to be your friend, 
if only for a short time.

15:55.780 --> 15:59.560
Do you remember the promise 
we made over that game of chess?

16:01.320 --> 16:05.780
The loser has to do one thing the 
winner says, no matter what it is.

16:08.960 --> 16:12.360
S-Seika, Fiona and your brother...

16:12.360 --> 16:14.440
Amyu, shut up for a second.

16:15.520 --> 16:16.570
What possible reason...

16:17.590 --> 16:20.250
would I have to trust you?

16:23.670 --> 16:25.070
Seika, you...

16:25.070 --> 16:27.790
I understand. Very well.

16:27.790 --> 16:30.990
Take Amyu and go, then.

16:30.990 --> 16:34.050
Gly, call off the guards out front.

16:34.300 --> 16:35.130
All right.

16:36.900 --> 16:38.390
Seika...

16:38.730 --> 16:40.350
You don't need to say a word.

16:44.580 --> 16:46.520
This way.

16:46.960 --> 16:50.340
I'll take you to your carriage.

16:55.260 --> 16:57.200
There it is.

16:57.440 --> 17:00.030
Head to the Free City of Racna.

17:00.030 --> 17:02.870
I've already spoken to the mayor there.

17:03.410 --> 17:06.130
The cacrriage is stocked
with money and provisions.

17:06.130 --> 17:08.590
And Amyu's sword is waiting for her, too.

17:08.590 --> 17:09.290
Okay...

17:09.290 --> 17:11.610
Now, go.

17:11.610 --> 17:13.100
Let's go, Amyu.

17:15.540 --> 17:17.920
Thanks for this. It was a big help.

17:17.920 --> 17:19.800
Don't worry about it.

17:20.990 --> 17:24.930
When I was in that cell, 
Fiona and your brother came.

17:24.930 --> 17:29.060
They cheered me up and 
told me that I'd be out soon.

17:30.750 --> 17:34.650
It's going to be a cold night. 
Take that with you.

17:34.650 --> 17:35.650
Thanks.

17:36.110 --> 17:37.640
Farewell.

17:37.640 --> 17:40.330
I hope we'll get another chance to chat.

17:40.580 --> 17:43.750
Yeah. Bye, Fiona.

17:44.120 --> 17:46.780
Farewell, Amyu.

17:47.780 --> 17:49.810
Goodbye, Seika.

17:51.130 --> 17:56.880
Fiona, I know it was just a game, 
but I'm sorry I couldn't keep our promise.

17:57.230 --> 17:59.020
Don't worry about it.

17:59.020 --> 18:01.710
But a promise is a promise.

18:01.710 --> 18:04.430
So allow me to do this, at least.

18:05.680 --> 18:06.780
What are you...?

18:12.190 --> 18:14.690
On apaakuroti padaarusu.

18:14.690 --> 18:18.030
Samudisshuti ishutika ashutan puuruben.

18:21.280 --> 18:24.190
Vaklu herii samesanpurati rakushu.

18:25.810 --> 18:27.210
Saadanvastuo.

18:27.960 --> 18:30.250
Pashu aatiman.

18:41.710 --> 18:44.140
Now it's all back to normal.

18:46.130 --> 18:49.770
You've just made my life 
a lot harder, you know!

18:49.770 --> 18:55.340
I was planning on telling everyone 
that a powerful demon attacked!

18:55.340 --> 18:58.700
No, I thought it was for the best...

18:59.200 --> 19:02.770
But... that's just like you.

19:03.240 --> 19:05.490
Now, go, please.

19:05.960 --> 19:07.380
Farewell.

19:07.380 --> 19:10.750
I'm sure the day will 
come when we meet again.

19:18.400 --> 19:22.890
Seika, I still don't understand 
what just happened.

19:23.280 --> 19:27.410
I didn't understand what 
you and Fiona were saying.

19:27.920 --> 19:30.000
Was I about to die?

19:30.640 --> 19:33.310
I'm the hero, but I can't get stronger?

19:33.310 --> 19:36.410
I don't understand! Explain to me!

19:36.410 --> 19:37.550
Yeah.

19:37.550 --> 19:40.910
Wait. First we need to get 
away from the capital.

19:40.910 --> 19:42.490
Let's leave right now.

19:43.550 --> 19:44.880
Hey, Amyu.

19:44.880 --> 19:46.410
Can I ask you something?

19:47.140 --> 19:48.110
What?

19:49.560 --> 19:51.840
How do you drive a carriage?

19:58.850 --> 20:00.090
Fiona.

20:00.370 --> 20:02.510
Who is that?

20:03.070 --> 20:06.510
I've never seen such a powerful being.

20:06.790 --> 20:09.180
This generation's demon king.

20:09.500 --> 20:11.480
His highness, the demon king?

20:12.070 --> 20:15.860
Why would the demon king protect the hero?

20:16.540 --> 20:20.530
Because she's someone close to him.

20:20.530 --> 20:22.320
That's all?

20:22.890 --> 20:26.190
How do you know?

20:26.190 --> 20:27.700
I can tell.

20:28.120 --> 20:35.630
When I was young, I used my power 
again and again to try and meet him.

20:37.290 --> 20:42.300
Seika will have no choice but 
to use his power to help others.

20:42.820 --> 20:47.260
Even if he knows destruction 
awaits him at the end of that path.

20:55.590 --> 20:58.900
That's who he is... He's a kind person.

21:07.770 --> 21:10.790
You think Yifa and Mabel are worried?

21:10.790 --> 21:12.330
We'll have to apologize later.

21:12.830 --> 21:15.410
Guess we're expelled from the academy.

21:15.410 --> 21:17.250
We only had a year to go.

21:17.620 --> 21:19.170
Do you regret it?

21:19.930 --> 21:26.050
The one thing I regret is that I couldn't 
hear your speech to this year's new students.

21:26.050 --> 21:27.720
Forget that.

21:28.030 --> 21:29.560
It's fine.

21:29.560 --> 21:31.890
I always did want to go visit Racna.

21:32.570 --> 21:34.810
I'll do my best as an adventurer.

21:34.810 --> 21:38.620
Yeah. Teach me the ropes.

21:38.620 --> 21:41.760
Sure. We'll be together for a while, right?

21:41.760 --> 21:42.640
Yup!

21:44.530 --> 21:48.530
Episode 13:
A New Journey
